
<view class="ambient"></view>
<view class="intro">
  <view class="title">欢迎回家，搭配师</view>
  <view class="subtitle">非官方摄影助手</view>
  <view class="welcome-card glass-surface">
    <view class="album-art" aria-hidden="{{true}}">
      <view class="art-frame art-back"></view>
      <view class="art-frame art-front"><view class="camera-mark"><view class="camera-lens"></view></view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="card-title">{{albumTitle}}</view>
    <view class="card-copy">连接电脑，查看并保存你的暖暖照片</view>
    <navigator class="primary-action" url="/pages/local-gallery/index">打开相册 <text>›</text></navigator>
    <view class="local-note"><view class="status-dot"></view>与电脑连接同一 Wi-Fi</view>
  </view>
  <view class="preview-note">开发预览 · 照片和视频分别保存 · 穿搭参数与分享图</view>
  <button class="tools-toggle" bindtap="toggleTools" aria-expanded="{{toolsOpen}}">开发工具 <text>{{toolsOpen ? '−' : '+'}}</text></button>
  <view wx:if="{{toolsOpen}}" class="tools glass-surface">
    <view class="tools-caption">仅用于排查连接，不是日常浏览入口</view>
    <button class="secondary-action" bindtap="scanQr" loading="{{scanning}}" disabled="{{scanning}}">识别旧版连接码（不建立连接）</button>
    <navigator url="/pages/diagnostics/index">局域网 HTTPS 诊断 <text>›</text></navigator>
    <navigator url="/pages/tcp-diagnostics/index">局域网 TCP · 合成文本 <text>›</text></navigator>
    <navigator url="/pages/encrypted-diagnostics/index">加密通道 · 合成文本 <text>›</text></navigator>
    <navigator url="/pages/image-diagnostics/index">加密通道 · 合成图片 <text>›</text></navigator>
    <view class="status">
      <view>{{message}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{endpoint}}">电脑地址：{{endpoint}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{expiresAt}}">有效期至：{{expiresAt}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
